            "date": "2025-10-15T19:30:00+01:00",
            "stars": "3",
            "snippet": "Delicious food but we couldn’t hear anything over the music. Needs to decide whether it’s a restaurant or a concert venue",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Magdalena",
            "date": "2025-06-11T19:30:00+01:00",
            "stars": "4",
            "snippet": "Great food, set menu very reasonable but the cocktails are overpriced",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Samuel",
            "date": "2025-05-31T19:00:00+01:00",
            "stars": "3",
            "snippet": "I believe my experience isn’t representative of Boisdale but I was informed the Scottish Steak Supper I booked wasn’t available on Saturdays. The manager was indifferent and kept my family waiting.\nWe ordered something else but the steak was overcooked and nowhere near medium. The service standard isn’t up to par with modern establishments. Staff need better training.",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "amo",
            "date": "2025-02-15T20:15:00+00:00",
            "stars": "2",
            "snippet": "Wouldn't go again. Super expensive for what it was. We had the herring starter which was sold out but a variant gravalax was given (we were told which was fine) but it had no flavour whatsoever. My rib eye was slightly warm on arrival and no seasoning or flavour. We also has to wait for 10 minutes before being served when sat even though staff were flying past us attending to others. Attentative after being told so maybe just bad luck. Not worth the very high bill at all. If you like live jazz and whisky go. If your a foodie, maybe try elsewhere.",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Justine",
            "date": "2025-01-24T20:30:00+00:00",
            "stars": "3",
            "snippet": "Absolut tolle Atmosphäre super Musik immer wieder gerne",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Richard",
            "date": "2025-01-21T18:00:00+00:00",
            "stars": "4",
            "snippet": "We went at 6 pm, which is very early so rather empty. However, the food was excellent and the service really good.",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Chris",
            "date": "2024-12-12T18:45:00+00:00",
            "stars": "2",
            "snippet": "It is a convenient location close to the tube and DLR. We went early evening and so it wasn't too busy. There seemed to be a lot of staff, but they were not particularly attentive. We had to chase for drinks that were slow in arriving and the food also took a while to arrive. The food was Ok, but nothing special.",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Marcus",
            "date": "2024-12-12T12:30:00+00:00",
            "stars": "3",
            "snippet": "Loved the food.\nThe band were great if a little too loud to follow a conversation",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Patricia",
            "date": "2024-11-19T18:45:00+00:00",
            "stars": "5",
            "snippet": "Fantastic food, service and ambience!\nHighly recommend the live music for a fantastic evening",
            "tags": null
          },
          {
            "author": "Mpho",
            "date": "2024-10-26T18:30:00+01:00",
            "stars": "1",
            "snippet": "We found the reception staff to be a bit cold\nThe atmosphere was okay\nWe were served the wrong dish and drinks. We complained about drink which was replaced served with long and stern face\nWe payed for overpriced mediocre meal and left vowing not to go back to this restaurant again",
            "tags": null
          }
